    "detailed_description": "MechAvenger is a fast paced VR shooter and platformer about fighting robots after the end of humanity. Shoot, punch, jump and climb your way through the enemy horde, and shut down their factory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/baa6545b946889a0a6037a6f9acd9a88.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/baa6545b946889a0a6037a6f9acd9a88.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/baa6545b946889a0a6037a6f9acd9a88.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take down enemies with 9 unique weapons, using your quick reload belt to keep them firing! Bash your enemies with weapons and fists to knock them to the ground. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/2327f37a66d2cc3e4217b067e5fc6e42.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/2327f37a66d2cc3e4217b067e5fc6e42.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/2327f37a66d2cc3e4217b067e5fc6e42.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The robotic horde is plentiful, but ammo is not.  Search your environment for extra weapons and ammo. Kill stunned enemies with a melee hit for an ammo bonus!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/e9134d59d14f492dc63c28f6c7a69083.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/e9134d59d14f492dc63c28f6c7a69083.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/e9134d59d14f492dc63c28f6c7a69083.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Navigate platforming sections by climbing and flinging yourself off walls. Swing with the grappling hook to cross long pits and build speed. Get yourself out of harms way with your servo powered dodge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/62d409a635376eadc64d32689ae3f452.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/62d409a635376eadc64d32689ae3f452.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/62d409a635376eadc64d32689ae3f452.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "MechAvenger is a fast paced VR shooter and platformer about fighting robots after the end of humanity. Shoot, punch, jump and climb your way through the enemy horde, and shut down their factory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/baa6545b946889a0a6037a6f9acd9a88.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/baa6545b946889a0a6037a6f9acd9a88.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/baa6545b946889a0a6037a6f9acd9a88.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take down enemies with 9 unique weapons, using your quick reload belt to keep them firing! Bash your enemies with weapons and fists to knock them to the ground. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/2327f37a66d2cc3e4217b067e5fc6e42.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/2327f37a66d2cc3e4217b067e5fc6e42.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/2327f37a66d2cc3e4217b067e5fc6e42.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The robotic horde is plentiful, but ammo is not.  Search your environment for extra weapons and ammo. Kill stunned enemies with a melee hit for an ammo bonus!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/e9134d59d14f492dc63c28f6c7a69083.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/e9134d59d14f492dc63c28f6c7a69083.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/e9134d59d14f492dc63c28f6c7a69083.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Navigate platforming sections by climbing and flinging yourself off walls. Swing with the grappling hook to cross long pits and build speed. Get yourself out of harms way with your servo powered dodge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/62d409a635376eadc64d32689ae3f452.poster.avif?t=1704898938\" width=224 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/62d409a635376eadc64d32689ae3f452.webm?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716730/extras/62d409a635376eadc64d32689ae3f452.mp4?t=1704898938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
